{"clips": [{"at": 0.0, "clipType": "text", "hold": 177.533, "id": "brand_wordmark", "params": {"anchor": "top-right", "offsetX": 48, "offsetY": 40, "textShadow": "0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.75)"}, "text": {"align": "right", "bold": true, "color": "#ffffff", "content": "ASTRID", "fontSize": 30}, "track": "brand"}, {"asset": "vo_open", "at": 0.0, "clipType": "media", "from": 0.0, "id": "vo_open", "to": 5.314, "track": "a1"}, {"at": 0.0, "clipType": "text", "effects": {"fade_in": 0.2, "fade_out": 0.2}, "hold": 5.664, "id": "cap_open", "params": {"anchor": "bottom-center", "maxWidth": 1500, "offsetY": 56, "textShadow": "0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.95)", "weight": 500}, "text": {"align": "center", "bold": false, "color": "#ffffff", "content": "Astrid is an extendable agent toolset, focused on the open-source AI art ecosystem.", "fontSize": 30}, "track": "captions"}, {"asset": "img_open", "at": 0.0, "clipType": "media", "hold": 5.664, "id": "broll_open", "track": "broll"}, {"asset": "vo_two_ideas", "at": 5.664, "clipType": "media", "from": 0.0, "id": "vo_two_ideas", "to": 1.611, "track": "a1"}, {"at": 5.664, "clipType": "text", "effects": {"fade_in": 0.2, "fade_out": 0.2}, "hold": 1.961, "id": "cap_two_ideas", "params": {"anchor": "bottom-center", "maxWidth": 1500, "offsetY": 56, "textShadow": "0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.95)", "weight": 500}, "text": {"align": "center", "bold": false, "color": "#ffffff", "content": "It's built around two ideas.", "fontSize": 30}, "track": "captions"}, {"asset": "img_two_ideas", "at": 5.664, "clipType": "media", "hold": 1.961, "id": "broll_two_ideas", "track": "broll"}, {"asset": "vo_recap1", "at": 7.625, "clipType": "media", "from": 0.0, "id": "vo_recap1", "to": 5.297, "track": "a1"}, {"at": 7.625, "clipType": "text", "effects": {"fade_in": 0.2, "fade_out": 0.2}, "hold": 5.647, "id": "cap_recap1", "params": {"anchor": "bottom-center", "maxWidth": 1500, "offsetY": 56, "textShadow": "0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.95)", "weight": 500}, "text": {"align": "center", "bold": false, "color": "#ffffff", "content": "One: giving agents tools and structures that make complex multimedia and AI work easy.", "fontSize": 30}, "track": "captions"}, {"asset": "img_recap1", "at": 7.625, "clipType": "media", "hold": 5.647, "id": "broll_recap1", "track": "broll"}, {"asset": "vo_recap2", "at": 13.272, "clipType": "media", "from": 0.0, "id": "vo_recap2", "to": 4.995, "track": "a1"}, {"at": 13.272, "clipType": "text", "effects": {"fade_in": 0.2, "fade_out": 0.2}, "hold": 5.345, "id": "cap_recap2", "params": {"anchor": "bottom-center", "maxWidth": 1500, "offsetY": 56, "textShadow": "0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.95)", "weight": 500}, "text": {"align": "center", "bold": false, "color": "#ffffff", "content": "Two: giving agents reflective, creative, and technical knowledge of each system.", "fontSize": 30}, "track": "captions"}, {"asset": "img_recap2", "at": 13.272, "clipType": "media", "hold": 5.345, "id": "broll_recap2", "track": "broll"}, {"asset": "vo_idea1_intro", "at": 18.617, "clipType": "media", "from": 0.0, "id": "vo_idea1_intro", "to": 6.761, "track": "a1"}, {"at": 18.617, "clipType": "text", "effects": {"fade_in": 0.2, "fade_out": 0.2}, "hold": 7.111, "id": "cap_idea1_intro", "params": {"anchor": "bottom-center", "maxWidth": 1500, "offsetY": 56, "textShadow": "0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.95)", "weight": 500}, "text": {"align": "center", "bold": false, "color": "#ffffff", "content": "Going into the first: there's a lot of complexity to working with open-source models, and Astrid is built to live in that world.", "fontSize": 30}, "track": "captions"}, {"asset": "img_idea1_intro", "at": 18.617, "clipType": "media", "hold": 7.111, "id": "broll_idea1_intro", "track": "broll"}, {"asset": "vo_idea1_os", "at": 25.728, "clipType": "media", "from": 0.0, "id": "vo_idea1_os", "to": 3.335, "track": "a1"}, {"at": 25.728, "clipType": "text", "effects": {"fade_in": 0.2, "fade_out": 0.2}, "hold": 3.685, "id": "cap_idea1_os", "params": {"anchor": "bottom-center", "maxWidth": 1500, "offsetY": 56, "textShadow": "0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.95)", "weight": 500}, "text": {"align": "center", "bold": false, "color": "#ffffff", "content": "Deep connectors let agents work on top of open-source tools.", "fontSize": 30}, "track": "captions"}, {"asset": "img_idea1_os", "at": 25.728, "clipType": "media", "hold": 3.685, "id": "broll_idea1_os", "track": "broll"}, {"asset": "vo_idea1_vc", "at": 29.413, "clipType": "media", "from": 0.0, "id": "vo_idea1_vc", "to": 7.525, "track": "a1"}, {"at": 29.413, "clipType": "text", "effects": {"fade_in": 0.2, "fade_out": 0.2}, "hold": 7.875, "id": "cap_idea1_vc", "params": {"anchor": "bottom-center", "maxWidth": 1500, "offsetY": 56, "textShadow": "0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.95)", "weight": 500}, "text": {"align": "center", "bold": false, "color": "#ffffff", "content": "For example, VibeComfy lets your agent deeply understand VibeComfy workflows and the ecosystem around them \u2014 and work within them.", "fontSize": 30}, "track": "captions"}, {"asset": "img_idea1_vc", "at": 29.413, "clipType": "media", "hold": 7.875, "id": "broll_idea1_vc", "track": "broll"}, {"asset": "vo_idea1_more", "at": 37.288, "clipType": "media", "from": 0.0, "id": "vo_idea1_more", "to": 6.734, "track": "a1"}, {"at": 37.288, "clipType": "text", "effects": {"fade_in": 0.2, "fade_out": 0.2}, "hold": 7.084, "id": "cap_idea1_more", "params": {"anchor": "bottom-center", "maxWidth": 1500, "offsetY": 56, "textShadow": "0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.95)", "weight": 500}, "text": {"align": "center", "bold": false, "color": "#ffffff", "content": "Connectors to tools like AI Toolkit let it train new models, and it can additionally hook into any MCP server for more.", "fontSize": 30}, "track": "captions"}, {"asset": "img_idea1_more", "at": 37.288, "clipType": "media", "hold": 7.084, "id": "broll_idea1_more", "track": "broll"}, {"asset": "vo_idea1_mm", "at": 44.372, "clipType": "media", "from": 0.0, "id": "vo_idea1_mm", "to": 12.565, "track": "a1"}, {"at": 44.372, "clipType": "text", "effects": {"fade_in": 0.2, "fade_out": 0.2}, "hold": 12.915, "id": "cap_idea1_mm", "params": {"anchor": "bottom-center", "maxWidth": 1500, "offsetY": 56, "textShadow": "0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.95)", "weight": 500}, "text": {"align": "center", "bold": false, "color": "#ffffff", "content": "Second, for working with multimedia: we provide tools for agents to work with complex forms like video timelines \u2014 to understand them, and work with them in depth, using both image and video understanding models.", "fontSize": 30}, "track": "captions"}, {"asset": "img_idea1_mm", "at": 44.372, "clipType": "media", "hold": 12.915, "id": "broll_idea1_mm", "track": "broll"}, {"asset": "vo_idea1_data", "at": 57.287, "clipType": "media", "from": 0.0, "id": "vo_idea1_data", "to": 8.495, "track": "a1"}, {"at": 57.287, "clipType": "text", "effects": {"fade_in": 0.2, "fade_out": 0.2}, "hold": 8.845, "id": "cap_idea1_data", "params": {"anchor": "bottom-center", "maxWidth": 1500, "offsetY": 56, "textShadow": "0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.95)", "weight": 500}, "text": {"align": "center", "bold": false, "color": "#ffffff", "content": "And third, there's a built-in data structure that automatically organizes all of your actions and all of your generations, and gives agents tools to work with them.", "fontSize": 30}, "track": "captions"}, {"asset": "img_idea1_data", "at": 57.287, "clipType": "media", "hold": 8.845, "id": "broll_idea1_data", "track": "broll"}, {"asset": "vo_idea1_defaults", "at": 66.132, "clipType": "media", "from": 0.0, "id": "vo_idea1_defaults", "to": 6.503, "track": "a1"}, {"at": 66.132, "clipType": "text", "effects": {"fade_in": 0.2, "fade_out": 0.2}, "hold": 6.853, "id": "cap_idea1_defaults", "params": {"anchor": "bottom-center", "maxWidth": 1500, "offsetY": 56, "textShadow": "0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.95)", "weight": 500}, "text": {"align": "center", "bold": false, "color": "#ffffff", "content": "For each of these, we provide strong defaults that you can customize as you please. Everything is built to be a plugin.", "fontSize": 30}, "track": "captions"}, {"asset": "img_idea1_defaults", "at": 66.132, "clipType": "media", "hold": 6.853, "id": "broll_idea1_defaults", "track": "broll"}, {"asset": "vo_idea2_intro", "at": 72.985, "clipType": "media", "from": 0.0, "id": "vo_idea2_intro", "to": 4.749, "track": "a1"}, {"at": 72.985, "clipType": "text", "effects": {"fade_in": 0.2, "fade_out": 0.2}, "hold": 5.099, "id": "cap_idea2_intro", "params": {"anchor": "bottom-center", "maxWidth": 1500, "offsetY": 56, "textShadow": "0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.95)", "weight": 500}, "text": {"align": "center", "bold": false, "color": "#ffffff", "content": "The second is Hivemind \u2014 an open collection of messages and workflows from the community.", "fontSize": 30}, "track": "captions"}, {"asset": "img_idea2_intro", "at": 72.985, "clipType": "media", "hold": 5.099, "id": "broll_idea2_intro", "track": "broll"}, {"asset": "vo_idea2_bestprac", "at": 78.084, "clipType": "media", "from": 0.0, "id": "vo_idea2_bestprac", "to": 8.698, "track": "a1"}, {"at": 78.084, "clipType": "text", "effects": {"fade_in": 0.2, "fade_out": 0.2}, "hold": 9.048, "id": "cap_idea2_bestprac", "params": {"anchor": "bottom-center", "maxWidth": 1500, "offsetY": 56, "textShadow": "0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.95)", "weight": 500}, "text": {"align": "center", "bold": false, "color": "#ffffff", "content": "When you ask a query, it references and understands best practices from across the ecosystem, as well as guides others have added from their own experience.", "fontSize": 30}, "track": "captions"}, {"asset": "img_idea2_bestprac", "at": 78.084, "clipType": "media", "hold": 9.048, "id": "broll_idea2_bestprac", "track": "broll"}, {"asset": "vo_idea2_contribute", "at": 87.132, "clipType": "media", "from": 0.0, "id": "vo_idea2_contribute", "to": 14.701, "track": "a1"}, {"at": 87.132, "clipType": "text", "effects": {"fade_in": 0.2, "fade_out": 0.2}, "hold": 15.051, "id": "cap_idea2_contribute", "params": {"anchor": "bottom-center", "maxWidth": 1500, "offsetY": 56, "textShadow": "0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.95)", "weight": 500}, "text": {"align": "center", "bold": false, "color": "#ffffff", "content": "While Hivemind already has thousands of workflows and a million-plus messages \u2014 and lots more right now \u2014 the goal is that your agents add to it as you discover things, as you learn best practices. It automatically adds to this repository that you just use and learn from.", "fontSize": 30}, "track": "captions"}, {"asset": "img_idea2_contribute", "at": 87.132, "clipType": "media", "hold": 15.051, "id": "broll_idea2_contribute", "track": "broll"}, {"asset": "vo_example_intro", "at": 102.183, "clipType": "media", "from": 0.0, "id": "vo_example_intro", "to": 2.464, "track": "a1"}, {"at": 102.183, "clipType": "text", "effects": {"fade_in": 0.2, "fade_out": 0.2}, "hold": 2.814, "id": "cap_example_intro", "params": {"anchor": "bottom-center", "maxWidth": 1500, "offsetY": 56, "textShadow": "0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.95)", "weight": 500}, "text": {"align": "center", "bold": false, "color": "#ffffff", "content": "So here's an example of all of this in action.", "fontSize": 30}, "track": "captions"}, {"asset": "img_example_intro", "at": 102.183, "clipType": "media", "hold": 2.814, "id": "broll_example_intro", "track": "broll"}, {"asset": "vo_ex_desert", "at": 104.99700000000001, "clipType": "media", "from": 0.0, "id": "vo_ex_desert", "to": 5.418, "track": "a1"}, {"at": 104.99700000000001, "clipType": "text", "effects": {"fade_in": 0.2, "fade_out": 0.2}, "hold": 5.768, "id": "cap_ex_desert", "params": {"anchor": "bottom-center", "maxWidth": 1500, "offsetY": 56, "textShadow": "0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.95)", "weight": 500}, "text": {"align": "center", "bold": false, "color": "#ffffff", "content": "I wanted to make this exact video, and the first clip is a plant growing out of the soil in the desert.", "fontSize": 30}, "track": "captions"}, {"asset": "img_ex_desert", "at": 104.99700000000001, "clipType": "media", "hold": 5.768, "id": "broll_ex_desert", "track": "broll"}, {"asset": "vo_ex_flux", "at": 110.76500000000001, "clipType": "media", "from": 0.0, "id": "vo_ex_flux", "to": 4.954, "track": "a1"}, {"at": 110.76500000000001, "clipType": "text", "effects": {"fade_in": 0.2, "fade_out": 0.2}, "hold": 5.304, "id": "cap_ex_flux", "params": {"anchor": "bottom-center", "maxWidth": 1500, "offsetY": 56, "textShadow": "0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.95)", "weight": 500}, "text": {"align": "center", "bold": false, "color": "#ffffff", "content": "I use Flux Kline to generate a lot of different samples and find ones I eventually like.", "fontSize": 30}, "track": "captions"}, {"asset": "img_ex_flux", "at": 110.76500000000001, "clipType": "media", "hold": 5.304, "id": "broll_ex_flux", "track": "broll"}, {"asset": "vo_ex_gpt", "at": 116.06900000000002, "clipType": "media", "from": 0.0, "id": "vo_ex_gpt", "to": 5.699, "track": "a1"}, {"at": 116.06900000000002, "clipType": "text", "effects": {"fade_in": 0.2, "fade_out": 0.2}, "hold": 6.049, "id": "cap_ex_gpt", "params": {"anchor": "bottom-center", "maxWidth": 1500, "offsetY": 56, "textShadow": "0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.95)", "weight": 500}, "text": {"align": "center", "bold": false, "color": "#ffffff", "content": "Then, for the hard shot, I use GPT Image \u2014 all of these, through built-in connectors.", "fontSize": 30}, "track": "captions"}, {"asset": "img_ex_gpt", "at": 116.06900000000002, "clipType": "media", "hold": 6.049, "id": "broll_ex_gpt", "track": "broll"}, {"asset": "vo_ex_minimax", "at": 122.11800000000002, "clipType": "media", "from": 0.0, "id": "vo_ex_minimax", "to": 3.296, "track": "a1"}, {"at": 122.11800000000002, "clipType": "text", "effects": {"fade_in": 0.2, "fade_out": 0.2}, "hold": 3.646, "id": "cap_ex_minimax", "params": {"anchor": "bottom-center", "maxWidth": 1500, "offsetY": 56, "textShadow": "0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.95)", "weight": 500}, "text": {"align": "center", "bold": false, "color": "#ffffff", "content": "Then I use Minimax to generate a bunch of different variants.", "fontSize": 30}, "track": "captions"}, {"asset": "img_ex_minimax", "at": 122.11800000000002, "clipType": "media", "hold": 3.646, "id": "broll_ex_minimax", "track": "broll"}, {"asset": "vo_ex_glitch", "at": 125.76400000000002, "clipType": "media", "from": 0.0, "id": "vo_ex_glitch", "to": 4.705, "track": "a1"}, {"at": 125.76400000000002, "clipType": "text", "effects": {"fade_in": 0.2, "fade_out": 0.2}, "hold": 5.055, "id": "cap_ex_glitch", "params": {"anchor": "bottom-center", "maxWidth": 1500, "offsetY": 56, "textShadow": "0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.95)", "weight": 500}, "text": {"align": "center", "bold": false, "color": "#ffffff", "content": "So I have this one that looks good, but then there's a weird glitch in it that I need to replace.", "fontSize": 30}, "track": "captions"}, {"asset": "img_ex_glitch", "at": 125.76400000000002, "clipType": "media", "hold": 5.055, "id": "broll_ex_glitch", "track": "broll"}, {"asset": "vo_ex_match", "at": 130.81900000000002, "clipType": "media", "from": 0.0, "id": "vo_ex_match", "to": 9.726, "track": "a1"}, {"at": 130.81900000000002, "clipType": "text", "effects": {"fade_in": 0.2, "fade_out": 0.2}, "hold": 10.076, "id": "cap_ex_match", "params": {"anchor": "bottom-center", "maxWidth": 1500, "offsetY": 56, "textShadow": "0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.95)", "weight": 500}, "text": {"align": "center", "bold": false, "color": "#ffffff", "content": "It finds the matching workflow for using masks with Minimax, and generates the fixed clip \u2014 even spinning up a RunPod instance, because my GPU is too slow for this.", "fontSize": 30}, "track": "captions"}, {"asset": "img_ex_match", "at": 130.81900000000002, "clipType": "media", "hold": 10.076, "id": "broll_ex_match", "track": "broll"}, {"asset": "vo_ex_map", "at": 140.895, "clipType": "media", "from": 0.0, "id": "vo_ex_map", "to": 9.072, "track": "a1"}, {"at": 140.895, "clipType": "text", "effects": {"fade_in": 0.2, "fade_out": 0.2}, "hold": 9.422, "id": "cap_ex_map", "params": {"anchor": "bottom-center", "maxWidth": 1500, "offsetY": 56, "textShadow": "0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.95)", "weight": 500}, "text": {"align": "center", "bold": false, "color": "#ffffff", "content": "Now that I have the first shot, I map out the rest \u2014 based on the timing of the music, it suggests transition points, and I work with it to get them perfect.", "fontSize": 30}, "track": "captions"}, {"asset": "img_ex_map", "at": 140.895, "clipType": "media", "hold": 9.422, "id": "broll_ex_map", "track": "broll"}, {"asset": "vo_ex_prompts", "at": 150.317, "clipType": "media", "from": 0.0, "id": "vo_ex_prompts", "to": 7.649, "track": "a1"}, {"at": 150.317, "clipType": "text", "effects": {"fade_in": 0.2, "fade_out": 0.2}, "hold": 7.999, "id": "cap_ex_prompts", "params": {"anchor": "bottom-center", "maxWidth": 1500, "offsetY": 56, "textShadow": "0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.95)", "weight": 500}, "text": {"align": "center", "bold": false, "color": "#ffffff", "content": "Then we work with the LLM to generate prompts for each of these segments \u2014 and I keep getting feedback on the overall trajectory of the video.", "fontSize": 30}, "track": "captions"}, {"asset": "img_ex_prompts", "at": 150.317, "clipType": "media", "hold": 7.999, "id": "broll_ex_prompts", "track": "broll"}, {"asset": "vo_cta_agents", "at": 158.316, "clipType": "media", "from": 0.0, "id": "vo_cta_agents", "to": 9.418, "track": "a1"}, {"at": 158.316, "clipType": "text", "effects": {"fade_in": 0.2, "fade_out": 0.2}, "hold": 9.768, "id": "cap_cta_agents", "params": {"anchor": "bottom-center", "maxWidth": 1500, "offsetY": 56, "textShadow": "0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.95)", "weight": 500}, "text": {"align": "center", "bold": false, "color": "#ffffff", "content": "One more thing \u2014 Astrid works as a tool you use with other agents, like Codex, Claude, or Hermes. Or you can run it independently, all on its own.", "fontSize": 30}, "track": "captions"}, {"asset": "img_cta_agents", "at": 158.316, "clipType": "media", "hold": 9.768, "id": "broll_cta_agents", "track": "broll"}, {"asset": "vo_cta", "at": 168.084, "clipType": "media", "from": 0.0, "id": "vo_cta", "to": 9.099, "track": "a1"}, {"at": 168.084, "clipType": "text", "effects": {"fade_in": 0.2, "fade_out": 0.2}, "hold": 9.449, "id": "cap_cta", "params": {"anchor": "bottom-center", "maxWidth": 1500, "offsetY": 56, "textShadow": "0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.95)", "weight": 500}, "text": {"align": "center", "bold": false, "color": "#ffffff", "content": "If you want to try Astrid, give feedback, or join me in the Discord where I'm building this \u2014 you'll find instructions on GitHub and Discord. Links are below!", "fontSize": 30}, "track": "captions"}, {"asset": "img_cta", "at": 168.084, "clipType": "media", "hold": 9.449, "id": "broll_cta", "track": "broll"}], "output": {"file": "parent-shot-graph.mp4", "fps": 30, "resolution": "1920x1080"}, "theme": "banodoco-default", "theme_overrides": {"visual": {"backgroundColor": "#0b0b0d", "canvas": {"fps": 30, "height": 1080, "width": 1920}}}, "tracks": [{"id": "brand", "kind": "visual", "label": "Brand"}, {"id": "captions", "kind": "visual", "label": "Captions"}, {"id": "broll", "kind": "visual", "label": "B-Roll"}, {"id": "a1", "kind": "audio", "label": "VO"}]}